  "finding": "The raw GLBs already contain body-skin and lips COLOR_0 alpha1. Import did not lose target semantic masks. These ordinary opaque PBR surfaces are outside the four secondary shader domains; alpha is not a motion weight there.",
  "positive_alpha_rows_across_three_live_bodies": 118511,
  "required_gate": "Every moving domain has anchored/free semantic weights and the real secondary shader; no ordinary skin surface receives it, and bow weights stay zero. A deliberately misplaced nonzero-offset secondary shader on actual skin must fail."
